      "content": "You need to create a powerful, uncompromising declaration that speaks directly to the spirit of the original movement. Frame your message not as a complaint, but as a necessary reclamation of authenticity and artistry. Use the specific, visceral language from your original vision to create sharp contrast with the current \"hollow pop shell.\" By being passionately and uncompromisingly \"you,\" you can create a powerful counter-narrative that resonates with those who truly understand the aesthetic.",
